        "appearance": "Size: Small. Mysterious tattoo location: middle of back of neck.",
        "biography": "Goes by Bree. Born and lived on the Island of Absalom, specifically the northwest corner of the Immenwood forest. Grew up and wandered between a half-dozen small communities, including a large Iruxi (Lizardfolk) tribe.\n\nHas a friend moth named Rosa (not a familiar, but an actual moth). Has followed the coaxing breezes of the Wild Mother out of the forest and into the larger world. Why the Wild Mother called her away is still unknown to Bree.\n\nCharacter portrait reference: https://twitter.com/Max_Dunbar/status/1631807894113984512",
        "showPersonality": true,
        "personalityTraits": "Playful; mischievous; good natured; motherly. Wants to always be useful and active and doing.",
        "ideals": "",
        "bonds": "",
        "flaws": "",
        "deity": "Melora, the Wild Mother",
        "birthplace": "",
        "nationality": "",
        "ethnicity": "",
        "alias": "Bree",
        "likesDislikes": "Likes: Mushrooms! Her forest communities; being a steward of a forest and helper of its denizens; being older (far less dramatic than being younger).\n\nDislikes: Apathy; Unhelpfulness.",
        "alliesEnemies": "Allies: Rosa (giant moth animal companion); Garron Swiftstrider (Steve); Raevyn Talathyal (Josh)",
