    {
      "id": "module-038",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Campaign Notes",
      "colSpan": 8,
      "rowSpan": null,
      "order": 37,
      "theme": null,
      "textLight": false,
      "tabId": "tab-1",
      "content": "**Backstory**\n\nGoes by Bree. Born and lived on the Island of Absalom, specifically the northwest corner of the Immenwood forest. Grew up and wandered between a half-dozen small communities, including a large Iruxi (Lizardfolk) tribe.\n\nHas a friend moth named Rosa (not a familiar, but an actual moth). Has followed the coaxing breezes of the Wild Mother out of the forest and into the larger world. Why the Wild Mother called her away is still unknown to Bree.\n\n**Leshy Familiar — Mushroom Hair**\n\nTiny fungus, mushroom symbiote. Mated hyphae implanted in the brain stem — mycelium network grows in a symbiotic relationship.\n- HP = 5 × my level\n- AC = my AC\n- Save Modifiers = my Save Modifiers\n- Perception, Acrobatics, and Stealth modifiers equal to my level plus my spellcasting modifier\n\n**Allies**\n\nRosa (giant moth animal companion); Garron Swiftstrider (Steve); Raevyn Talathyal (Josh)\n\n**Reference**\n\nCharacter portrait: https://twitter.com/Max_Dunbar/status/1631807894113984512"
    },
    {
      "id": "module-039",
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reactions & Free Actions",
      "colSpan": 8,
      "rowSpan": null,
      "order": 38,
      "theme": null,
      "textLight": false,
      "tabId": "tab-1",
      "content": "**Shield Block** — Reaction — Traits: general\n\nTrigger: While you have your shield raised, you would take physical damage (bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing) from an attack.\n\nEffect: You snap your shield in place to ward off a blow.\n\n---\n\n**Eerie Flicker** — Reaction — Traits: rare, deviant, magical\n\nTrigger: An enemy's Strike would hit you and you weren't already concealed, hidden, or undetected by that enemy.\n\nEffect: Your body flickers momentarily into the Ethereal Plane.\n\n---\n\n**Battle Medicine** — 1 Action — Traits: general, healing, manipulate, skill\n\nEffect: You can patch up wounds, even in combat.\n\n---\n\n**Blasting Beams** — 1 Action — Traits: rare, attack, deviant, magical\n\nEffect: A directed beam of heat or an arc of lightning is one of the simplest ways to project energy."
    },
